    RefIds:
    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: ee7696869a6d413ead9ebb2c4d141e61
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'TECH support agent (field engineer): keeps its squad''s shields up from the back. In a fight it holds the spot that reaches the most allies with its Shield Projector (8 m), behind the ally nearest the threat by about 5 m and in cover facing the threat, high cover first, and plans again every 2 s as the line moves; it shoots from there. It breaks off to top up whoever is being hit or worn down (Support), throws a Barrier Field (Signature: +60 armour) over the squad when two or more fight near it, shelters behind a shield-bearer when one is about, and falls back toward its line when pressed. Calm, it follows its leader and patches up anyone still hurt. Kit: Support (Shield Projector), Signature (Barrier Field).'
        _children:
        - 7d9f1c0b1b3f48e18481ee573d306a07
